text:
Interactive Album Comparison Tool
Pick any album below to instantly inspect its most similar and least similar matches.



&lt;!-- Step 1: Pick Artist --&gt;
&lt;div style="flex: 1; min-width: 200px;"&gt;
  &lt;label for="artist-picker" style="font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #1e293b;"&gt;
    1. Pick an Artist:
  &lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;select id="artist-picker" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 1rem; background: white;"&gt;
    &lt;option value="Taylor Swift" selected&gt;Taylor Swift&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="Red Hot Chili Peppers"&gt;Red Hot Chili Peppers&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- Step 2: Pick Album from Artist --&gt;
&lt;div style="flex: 1.5; min-width: 240px;"&gt;
  &lt;label for="album-picker" style="font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #1e293b;"&gt;
    2. Pick an Album:
  &lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;select id="album-picker" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 1rem; background: white;"&gt;
    &lt;!-- Populated dynamically by artist --&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- Step 3: Pick Metric --&gt;
&lt;div style="width: 220px;"&gt;
  &lt;label for="metric-picker" style="font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; color: #1e293b;"&gt;
    3. Compare By:
  &lt;/label&gt;
  &lt;select id="metric-picker" style="width: 100%; padding: 8px 12px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; font-size: 1rem; background: white;"&gt;
    &lt;option value="overall" selected&gt;Combined (Color & Design)&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="color"&gt;Color Palette Only&lt;/option&gt;
    &lt;option value="design"&gt;Spatial Design Only&lt;/option&gt;
  &lt;/select&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;





&lt;!-- Injected by JS --&gt;



&lt;!-- Most Similar --&gt;
&lt;div style="background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px;"&gt;
  &lt;h4 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #166534; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;🟢&lt;/span&gt; Most Similar Album Covers
  &lt;/h4&gt;
  &lt;div id="most-similar-cards" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 14px;"&gt;
    &lt;!-- Injected by JS --&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;!-- Least Similar --&gt;
&lt;div style="background: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px;"&gt;
  &lt;h4 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 12px; color: #991b1b; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"&gt;
    &lt;span&gt;🔴&lt;/span&gt; Least Similar Album Covers
  &lt;/h4&gt;
  &lt;div id="least-similar-cards" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 14px;"&gt;
    &lt;!-- Injected by JS --&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
